## Title: Preview Anywhere
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 1.1.0
## AddOnVersion: 10100
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: 3D item preview where the gamepad UI lacks it: R3 in the bank, house bank, Furnishing Vault, guild bank and vendor Sell/Buyback/Repair tabs; hold Square on item links in chat, mail and guild text; D-pad Left on any other item tooltip (trade, mail attachments, guild store, crafting). Also frames the inventory's own hold-Square preview beside the tooltip instead of behind it. Furnishings, plans, gear. /pva for commands.
## SavedVariables: PreviewAnywhereSavedVars
## OptionalDependsOn: LibConsoleLogger
## DevId: bc6b3b76-f701-4533-9492-c50acb1783bc
## ProdId: b5cc1fef-6afb-46ca-a772-f1b71c39530c

